      "text": "A particle moves in the plane with velocity vector \\( v(t) = \\left\\langle 3 t, 2 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\right\\rangle \\), with t in seconds and distance in meters, and it is at the origin at \\( t = 0 \\). Using a calculator, find the total distance the particle travels over \\( 0 \\le t \\le 1 \\). Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
